      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "The purpose is to evaluate the efficacy & safety between CreaVax-HCC and control group after first-line therapy in hepatocellular carcinoma, and the primary endpoint is a recurrence free survival rate of CreaVax-HCC and control group",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 21,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_중재상세설명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Dosage: 30 million cells/ injection Duration: 4 times every two weeks/ 2 times every four weeks/ total 6 times injections",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 22,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_1.중재군_군명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "CreaVax-HCC injection group",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 23,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_1.중재군_상세내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Dosage: 30 million cells/ injection Duration: 4 times every two weeks/ 2 times every four weeks/ total 6 times injections",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 24,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 포함기준_내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "(1) Among Patients with modified UICC Stage I, II and III by radiation examination (CT or MRI), a patient with CR (Complete response) state by resectable and/or non- resectable (TACE, PEIT, RFA) treatment (in less than 2 times) within 4 month registration (2) A patient aged over 20 / both male and female (3) A patient with ECOG scale (ECOG-PS) 0-1 (4) A patient over 3 months survival expected (5) Hemoglobin ≥ 8.5g/dL, WBC ≥ 2,000/mm3, Platelet ≥ 50,000/ mm3 (6) Child Pugh score ≤7, ALT(Alanine transaminase), AST(aspartate aminotransferase) ≤ 5 x ULN (7) Creatinine < 1.5mg/dL (8) A patient who signed the written consent form by onself",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 25,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 제외기준",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "(1) A patient with organ- transplantation (2) A patient with other cancer or the history of cancer within the last 5 years (3) A patient with the medical history of autoimmune disease or with immunodeficiency or autoimmune disease that might be aggravated by immunotherapy (4) A patient not exceeding two weeks after antibiotic treatment needed due to a serious infectious disease.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 26,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 제외기준",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "(5) A HIV positive patient (6) A patient with cardiopulmonary disability judged by the investigator (7) A patient with the medical history of psychological disease or epilepsy (8) A patient who has participated in another clinical trial within the last 4 weeks of the start of study (9) A pregnant woman, breast-feeding woman or woman who wants to be pregnant during the trial period (10)A patient with 4 month later after first-line therapy and a recurrent hepatocelluar carcinoma patient(1) A patient with systemic therapy to treat hepatocellular carcinoma (2) A patient administered immunosuppressive drug like cyclosporin A, Azathioprine",
      "align_score": null
    },
